  note "Its printed page numbers equal the PDF page numbers."
  note "A gives no dates, only that the replacement was bought within 30 days from the sale; stated_within carries that fact."
  note "D: all 300 shares were sold on one day; they are three sales of one block each, in the order the Pub lists the blocks (first, second, third)."
  note "E: the short sale is closed on November 19 by delivering the shares bought June 4; the Pub dates the sale at the short sale, October 15. No year is given."
